## 📁 Repository Architecture

This repository serves as a **living documentation system** for JavaScript mastery, organized with engineering precision.

### 📚 Core Curriculum Coverage

**FOUNDATIONS**
- Execution Context & Memory Management
- Variable Declarations (`var`, `let`, `const`) with Temporal Dead Zone analysis
- Type System: Primitives vs. Reference Types
- Operators & Type Coercion Rules

**FUNCTIONAL PROGRAMMING**
- First-Class Functions & Higher-Order Functions
- Closures & Lexical Environment
- Currying, Composition, and Pure Functions
- IIFE Patterns & Module Systems

**OBJECT-ORIENTED & PROTOTYPAL**
- Constructor Functions vs. Classes
- Prototype Chain & Inheritance Patterns
- `this` Binding Rules (Implicit, Explicit, `new`, Arrow)
- Property Descriptors & Object APIs

**ES6+ MODERN SPECIFICATIONS**
- Destructuring & Spread/Rest Operators
- Template Literals & Tagged Templates
- Symbols, Iterators, Generators
- Maps, Sets, Weak Collections

**ASYNCHRONOUS PATTERNS**
- Event Loop & Concurrency Model
- Callback Patterns & Error-First Convention
- Promise API & Microtask Queue
- Async/Await & Parallel Execution Strategies

**ERROR HANDLING & DEBUGGING**
- Structured Error Handling (`try/catch/finally`)
- Custom Error Types
- Stack Trace Analysis
- Memory Leak Detection

**PERFORMANCE OPTIMIZATION**
- Algorithmic Complexity Analysis
- Debouncing & Throttling
- Lazy Loading & Code Splitting
- Memory Optimization Techniques

**INTERVIEW READINESS**
- Data Structure Implementations
